This catalog reproduces only the ASI01–ASI10 short codes and titles from the
source. All summaries and descriptions in owasp-asi-catalog.json are original
wording authored for AIGP-Lite and are NOT verbatim OWASP text. Appendix-A
cross-mapping metadata (OWASP LLM Top 10, Agentic Threats T1–T17, AIVSS) is
stored as factual references only.
